(7281192, 1134833, 163430, '<td valign="top">I like it. It''s cute and interesting, unlike the challenge topic :-)<br/> <br/>My only two remarks are:<br/>- Noise. Lots of it. My philosophy is: "when you must go high ISO, go B&amp;W"<br/>- The composition. A more right, or lower right placement of the subject in the frame would have been more pleasing. At least to me.</td>', 'I like it. It''s cute and interesting, unlike the challenge topic :-) My only two remarks are:- Noise. Lots of it. My philosophy is: "when you must go high ISO, go B&W"- The composition. A more right, or lower right placement of the subject in the frame would have been more pleasing. At least to me.', '2014-11-06 18:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281193, 1134671, 163430, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the not so interesting challenge topic.</td>', 'Interesting take on the not so interesting challenge topic.', '2014-11-06 18:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281195, 1134664, 163430, '<td valign="top">BRAVO! One of my top three.<br/>Wonderful duotone, excellent silhouette and beautiful take on the challenge topic. I still cannot decide whether the lens flare bothers me or not :-)</td>', 'BRAVO! One of my top three.Wonderful duotone, excellent silhouette and beautiful take on the challenge topic. I still cannot decide whether the lens flare bothers me or not :-)', '2014-11-06 18:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281196, 1134712, 163430, '<td valign="top">Nice one, but i believe that B&amp;W would have worked better here.</td>', 'Nice one, but i believe that B&W would have worked better here.', '2014-11-06 18:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281197, 1134817, 163430, '<td valign="top">The idea is brilliant, but the image lacks overall sharpness, a bit of saturation on the subject and some contrast (darker, if not pitch black, background). It would have been a striking image. <br/> <br/>I would have been in my top 5 if only the photographic execution was a bit on a higher level.</td>', 'The idea is brilliant, but the image lacks overall sharpness, a bit of saturation on the subject and some contrast (darker, if not pitch black, background). It would have been a striking image.  I would have been in my top 5 if only the photographic execution was a bit on a higher level.', '2014-11-06 18:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7281198, 1134699, 163430, '<td valign="top">My brain hurts while looking at the image. In a good way :-)<br/>Nicely seen and a photographic execution to match.</td>', 'My brain hurts while looking at the image. In a good way :-)Nicely seen and a photographic execution to match.', '2014-11-06 18:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
