(7281202, 1134896, 163430, '<td valign="top">Good one. Best in show.<br/> <br/>Is it really a backflip or a normal jump with the camera upside down (or rotated in post, same difference)? It totally meets the challenge either way, i''m just asking  out of curiosity. My money is on rotation in post. The hat is too firm on his head and the shoelaces don''t seem to be affected by gravity :-)</td>', 'Good one. Best in show. Is it really a backflip or a normal jump with the camera upside down (or rotated in post, same difference)? It totally meets the challenge either way, i''m just asking  out of curiosity. My money is on rotation in post. The hat is too firm on his head and the shoelaces don''t seem to be affected by gravity :-)', '2014-11-06 19:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
