(7284680, 1134699, 156466, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by PennyStreet:</b></div><hr/><i> Congrats... very well seen. I''d love to see the original. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Here ya go...<br/> <br/>Original: <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1135364" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/155000-159999/156466/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1135364.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/155000-159999/156466/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1135364.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/155000-159999/156466/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1135364.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>And reversed:  <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1135365" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/155000-159999/156466/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1135365.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/155000-159999/156466/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1135365.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/155000-159999/156466/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1135365.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Originally posted by PennyStreet: Congrats... very well seen. I''d love to see the original.   Here ya go... Original:   And reversed:  ', '2014-11-12 09:24:33.000000', NULL, 0),
