(7284740, 1134699, 156466, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tanguera:</b></div><hr/><i> Congrats on the blue! Looks like you''ve finally figured this place out :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yeah, that''ll be the day.  LOL</td>', 'Originally posted by tanguera: Congrats on the blue! Looks like you''ve finally figured this place out :)   Yeah, that''ll be the day.  LOL', '2014-11-12 11:50:14.000000', NULL, 0),
