(7284784, 1134850, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very cool - I missed out on voting in this one but this would have been a 7 for the well balanced colors and the battle between sharpness and blur.</td>', 'Very cool - I missed out on voting in this one but this would have been a 7 for the well balanced colors and the battle between sharpness and blur.', '2014-11-12 13:38:41.000000', NULL, 0),
